# Security

- Never commit secrets; use `.env.example` as the template only.
- Keep security headers in `next.config.ts` (CSP, HSTS, frame denial, nosniff).
- Sanitize/validate all user input with zod before CRM submission.
- Do not introduce `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` except for trusted JSON-LD serialization.
- External links: use `rel="noopener noreferrer"` when `target="_blank"`.
- Avoid loading unneeded third-party scripts; gate analytics behind env flags when wired.
